# Pyroblast, second mode: "Destroy target permanent if it's blue." Bot1 has two Pyroblasts and two Mox Rubies. On turn 3 it aims
# the first at Bot2's Llanowar Elves, which is green: it resolves and does nothing, and the Elves survive. The second
# is aimed at Bot2's Faerie Mastermind, which is blue, and destroys it. (A Mox is colorless, so only a creature can show it.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Pyroblast
Pyroblast
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Faerie Mastermind
Llanowar Elves
Island x15

